[2026-10-01T07:20:53.797Z] INFO faser.utils_med: If someone is having an asthma attack without their inhaler, first aid steps include helping them sit upright, reassuring them, and asking simple questions to keep them calm. If available, use a spacer with a reliever medication (like a blue inhaler) to ensure the medication reaches their lungs effectively. If the attack worsens or the casualty becomes unconscious, call emergency services immediately.
